---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro'
import Logo from '../components/Logo.astro'

const DEMO_URL = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_DEMO_URL || '/demo'
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Transparent Economics — Open Source Core & Cloud SaaS" 
  description="Transparent healthcare dietary operations pricing. 100% free open-source community core. Proposed managed services and enterprise workflows subject to deployment and provider acceptance."
>
  <section class="marketing-page-intro py-16 sm:py-24 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-obsidian-border">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      <!-- Section Header -->
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mb-16">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-shoreline-500/10 border border-shoreline-500/20 text-shoreline-700 dark:text-shoreline-300 text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-shoreline-500"></span>
          <span>OPEN CORE LICENSING · ZERO CLINICAL LOCKOUT</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight mb-4 font-display">
          Predictable Care Economics.<br class="hidden sm:inline" />
          <span class="text-shoreline-600 dark:text-shoreline-400">Zero Clinical Lockout.</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          Core dietary workflows are available for self-hosting. Paid plans describe proposed managed services; confirm availability and complete facility acceptance before clinical use. Each facility currently requires its own deployment and database.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Unified 3-Tier Architectural Pricing Grid -->
      <div class="border border-slate-200 dark:border-obsidian-border rounded-xl bg-white dark:bg-obsidian-card shadow-surface divide-y lg:divide-y-0 lg:divide-x divide-slate-200 dark:divide-obsidian-border grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 mb-16">
        
        <!-- Tier 1: Free Community Core -->
        <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
              <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">01 / LOCAL CORE</span>
              <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-mono font-semibold bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-500/20">
                FREE FOREVER
              </span>
            </div>

            <div class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white font-display mb-1">Community Core</div>
            <div class="flex items-baseline gap-1 mb-3">
              <span class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white font-mono">$0</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-mono">/ facility / month</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
              Self-hosted dietary operations for a single facility. Devices require connectivity to the local application server; facility clinical and recovery acceptance is required.
            </p>

            <div class="text-[11px] font-mono font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400 mb-3">INCLUDED CAPABILITIES:</div>
            <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 mb-8">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <Icon name="check" class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
                <span><strong>Resident Profiles</strong> with diet orders</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <Icon name="check" class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
                <span><strong>IDDSI Texture Order Fields</strong> (Pureed L4, Minced L5)</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <Icon name="check" class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
                <span><strong>4-Week Seasonal Cycle Planner</strong> &amp; recipe book</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <Icon name="check" class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
                <span><strong>Touch Tablet Kiosk</strong> with 165°F HACCP temp logs</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <Icon name="check" class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
                <span><strong>Thermal Tray Card Printing</strong> (4" x 6" tickets)</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <Icon name="check" class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
                <span>Self-hosted SQLite / Docker Compose installation</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <a
            href="https://github.com/ShadowWalkerNC/ShorelineOps"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noreferrer"
            class="w-full py-2.5 px-4 text-center rounded-lg border border-slate-300 dark:border-obsidian-border bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 dark:bg-obsidian-surface dark:hover:bg-slate-800 text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-xs font-semibold font-mono uppercase tracking-wider transition-colors inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2"
          >
            <span>Deploy Core (GitHub)</span>
            <Icon name="arrow-right" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" />
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Tier 2: Managed Pro Cloud SaaS -->
        <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between bg-slate-50/50 dark:bg-obsidian-surface/60 relative">
          <div class="absolute -top-px left-0 right-0 h-1 bg-shoreline-500"></div>

          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
              <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-shoreline-700 dark:text-shoreline-300">02 / MANAGED SAAS</span>
              <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-mono font-semibold bg-shoreline-500/10 text-shoreline-700 dark:text-shoreline-300 border border-shoreline-500/30">
                RECOMMENDED
              </span>
            </div>

            <div class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white font-display mb-1">Pro Cloud SaaS</div>
            <div class="flex items-baseline gap-1 mb-3">
              <span class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white font-mono">$199</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-mono">/ facility / month</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
              Proposed managed hosting offer. Hosting safeguards, backups, recovery targets, and service commitments require a reviewed deployment and executed agreement.
            </p>

            <div class="text-[11px] font-mono font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400 mb-3">PROPOSED MANAGED SCOPE:</div>
            <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-xs text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 mb-8">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <Icon name="check" class="w-4 h-4 text-shoreline-600 dark:text-shoreline-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
                <span><strong>Managed Cloud Hosting</strong> — deployment acceptance required</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <Icon name="check" class="w-4 h-4 text-shoreline-600 dark:text-shoreline-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
                <span><strong>Backup &amp; Recovery Setup</strong> — schedule and restore testing by agreement</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <Icon name="check" class="w-4 h-4 text-shoreline-600 dark:text-shoreline-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
                <span><strong>Facility Privacy Agreement Review</strong> — BAA required where applicable</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <Icon name="check" class="w-4 h-4 text-shoreline-600 dark:text-shoreline-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
                <span><strong>Multi-Distributor Split MRP</strong> (Dennis, Sysco &amp; US Foods comparator)</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <Icon name="check" class="w-4 h-4 text-shoreline-600 dark:text-shoreline-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
                <span>Availability targets established by executed agreement</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <a
            href={DEMO_URL}
            class="w-full py-2.5 px-4 text-center rounded-lg bg-shoreline-600 hover:bg-shoreline-700 text-white text-xs font-semibold font-mono uppercase tracking-wider shadow-sm transition-colors inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2"
          >
            <span>Launch Live Sandbox</span>
            <Icon name="arrow-right" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" />
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Tier 3: Enterprise Care Network -->
        <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
              <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">03 / NETWORK SCALE</span>
              <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-mono font-semibold bg-purple-500/10 text-purple-700 dark:text-purple-300 border border-purple-500/20">
                MULTI-FACILITY
              </span>
            </div>

            <div class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white font-display mb-1">Enterprise Care Network</div>
            <div class="flex items-baseline gap-1 mb-3">
              <span class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white font-mono">$399</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-mono">/ facility / month</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
              Proposed enterprise workflows for separately deployed facilities. Provider credentials, clinical review, and workflow acceptance are required; shared clinical database isolation is not available.
            </p>

            <div class="text-[11px] font-mono font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400 mb-3">PROPOSED ENTERPRISE SCOPE:</div>
            <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 mb-8">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <Icon name="check" class="w-4 h-4 text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
                <span><strong>PointClickCare EHR Inbound Sync</strong> with RD triage gate</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <Icon name="check" class="w-4 h-4 text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
                <span><strong>CMS-2567 Federal Survey Binder</strong> &amp; 90-day HACCP export</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <Icon name="check" class="w-4 h-4 text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
                <span><strong>Multi-Facility Coordination</strong> — roadmap; separate deployments required</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <Icon name="check" class="w-4 h-4 text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
                <span><strong>3-Way Invoice Match Workflow</strong> with authorized review</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <Icon name="check" class="w-4 h-4 text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
                <span>Clinical review and EDI onboarding scope by agreement</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <a
            href="mailto:support@shorelineops.com?subject=Enterprise%20Care%20Network%20Inquiry"
            class="w-full py-2.5 px-4 text-center rounded-lg border border-slate-300 dark:border-obsidian-border bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 dark:bg-obsidian-surface dark:hover:bg-slate-800 text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-xs font-semibold font-mono uppercase tracking-wider transition-colors inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2"
          >
            <span>Inquire for Campus</span>
            <Icon name="arrow-right" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" />
          </a>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- Feature Comparison Architectural Table -->
      <div class="mb-16">
        <div class="text-center mb-8">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white font-display mb-2">
            Detailed Capability Comparison
          </h2>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500 font-mono">
            Intended plan scope. Managed services, provider integrations, and hardware workflows require separate acceptance.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="border border-slate-200 dark:border-obsidian-border rounded-xl bg-white dark:bg-obsidian-card shadow-surface overflow-hidden">
          <div class="marketing-table-scroll" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Compare plan capabilities; scroll horizontally on smaller screens">
            <table class="w-full text-left text-xs">
              <thead class="border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-obsidian-border bg-slate-50/75 dark:bg-obsidian-surface/80 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
                <tr>
                  <th class="py-3 px-4 font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Operational Capability</th>
                  <th class="py-3 px-4 text-center">Community Core ($0)</th>
                  <th class="py-3 px-4 text-center text-shoreline-700 dark:text-shoreline-300 bg-shoreline-500/5">Pro Cloud ($199/mo)</th>
                  <th class="py-3 px-4 text-center">Enterprise ($399/mo)</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody class="divide-y divide-slate-100 dark:divide-obsidian-border/50 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
                <tr>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 font-medium text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Resident Census &amp; Table Seats</td>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center font-mono text-emerald-600 font-bold">Facility scope</td>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center font-mono text-emerald-600 font-bold bg-shoreline-500/5">Facility scope</td>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center font-mono text-emerald-600 font-bold">Facility scope</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 font-medium text-slate-900 dark:text-white">IDDSI 2.0 Dysphagia Texture Rules</td>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center font-mono text-emerald-600 font-bold">Included</td>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center font-mono text-emerald-600 font-bold bg-shoreline-500/5">Included</td>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center font-mono text-emerald-600 font-bold">Included</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 font-medium text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Deterministic NPO Hard-Blocks</td>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center font-mono text-emerald-600 font-bold">Included</td>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center font-mono text-emerald-600 font-bold bg-shoreline-500/5">Included</td>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center font-mono text-emerald-600 font-bold">Included</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 font-medium text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Kitchen Tablet &amp; 165°F HACCP Logging</td>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center font-mono text-emerald-600 font-bold">Included</td>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center font-mono text-emerald-600 font-bold bg-shoreline-500/5">Included</td>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center font-mono text-emerald-600 font-bold">Included</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 font-medium text-slate-900 dark:text-white">High-Contrast Thermal Tray Cards (4" x 6")</td>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center font-mono text-emerald-600 font-bold">Included</td>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center font-mono text-emerald-600 font-bold bg-shoreline-500/5">Included</td>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center font-mono text-emerald-600 font-bold">Included</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 font-medium text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Managed Cloud Hosting &amp; Backups</td>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center font-mono text-slate-400">Self-Hosted</td>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center font-mono text-emerald-600 font-bold bg-shoreline-500/5">By agreement</td>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center font-mono text-emerald-600 font-bold">By agreement</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 font-medium text-slate-900 dark:text-white">PointClickCare Live EHR Connector</td>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center font-mono text-slate-400">—</td>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center font-mono text-slate-400 bg-shoreline-500/5">—</td>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center font-mono text-emerald-600 font-bold">Inbound; provider acceptance</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 font-medium text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Multi-Distributor Split MRP Optimization</td>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center font-mono text-slate-400">CSV Export</td>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center font-mono text-emerald-600 font-bold bg-shoreline-500/5">Comparator; acceptance required</td>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center font-mono text-emerald-600 font-bold">Provider acceptance required</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 font-medium text-slate-900 dark:text-white">CMS-2567 F-Tag State Survey Binder</td>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center font-mono text-slate-400">—</td>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center font-mono text-slate-400 bg-shoreline-500/5">—</td>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center font-mono text-emerald-600 font-bold">Binder; facility review</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 font-medium text-slate-900 dark:text-white">3-Way Invoice Match &amp; Credit Claims</td>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center font-mono text-slate-400">—</td>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center font-mono text-slate-400 bg-shoreline-500/5">—</td>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center font-mono text-emerald-600 font-bold">Included</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 font-medium text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Corporate Multi-Facility Rollup &amp; Syndication</td>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center font-mono text-slate-400">—</td>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center font-mono text-slate-400 bg-shoreline-500/5">—</td>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 text-center font-mono text-emerald-600 font-bold">Roadmap</td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Compliance & Standards Anchor Strip -->
      <div class="border border-slate-200 dark:border-obsidian-border rounded-xl p-6 bg-slate-50/50 dark:bg-obsidian-surface/60 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6">
        <div>
          <div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-1">
            Facility Acceptance &amp; Regulatory Review
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed max-w-xl">
            Terminology and operational checks support facility procedures. They do not establish HIPAA compliance, survey readiness, or physical texture safety. Review security requirements and validate your facility workflows before rollout.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 max-w-full">
          <Logo name="hipaa" />
          <Logo name="cms" />
          <Logo name="iddsi" />
          <Logo name="fhir" />
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
